TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-hep-th-9504111v1
AU  - Faddeev, L. D.
TI  - Discrete Heisenberg–Weyl group and modular group
DA  - D:20241126
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9504111
AB  - It is shown that the generators of two discrete Heisenberg-Weyl groups with irra- tional rotation numbers θ and −1/θ generate the whole algebra B of bounded operators on L2(R). The natural action of the modular group in B is implied. Applications to dynamical algebras appearing in lattice regularization and some duality principles are discussed.
ER  - 
